# --- LOCAL DATA CONFIGURATION ---

# 1. Ignore the main user_data folder by default
user_data/

# 2. EXCEPT: Re-include the specific folders you want to share
!user_data/sampler_data/
!user_data/stop_patterns_data/

# 3. Keep ignoring sensitive/private data (Characters, Chats, Contexts, Models)
# These will remain ignored because of rule #1, unless you explicitly un-ignore them too.
# user_data/character_data/  <- Uncomment if you also want to share characters
# user_data/context_data/    <- Uncomment if you also want to share contexts
# user_data/chat_data/       <- Keep ignored (private chats)
# user_data/chat_messages/   <- Keep ignored (private messages)
# user_data/model_data/      <- Keep ignored (local paths usually differ per user)

llama/